HST Office: Save As asks before macro edits would not reach a Word file.

Owner decision: a Word file keeps the VBA project it was read with, because Word does not open a
project written by HST, and macros edited in HST do not reach it. Saving such a document as .docm or
.doc now asks first: save without the macro edits, or choose another format.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
